Package: vra
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-yaml, python3-pydantic (>= 2), python3-sqlalchemy (>= 2), python3-jinja2 (>= 3.1), python3-rich (>= 13), python3-typer (>= 0.9)
Recommends: clang, cppcheck, semgrep
Maintainer: VRA Developers <dev@vra.local>
Homepage: https://github.com/vra/vra
Description: C/C++ Automated Vulnerability Research Workbench
 Multi-stage analysis pipeline for C/C++ codebases: project inspection,
 build-system detection, static analyzers, a regex/taint rule engine with a
 structural (rule-based) false-positive-reduction layer, optional LLM-backed
 review, and HTML/Markdown/JSON report generation.
 .
 The native C accelerator (vra._native) is compiled automatically at install
 time when a C compiler is available; the pure-Python fallback is used
 otherwise.
